  * refactor(cli): unify the three byte-identical printPostActionList
    copies in start/stop/restart behind a single
    list.FetchAndRender(client, highlight). The helper lives in the
    list package since all three callers already imported it for
    Render, and the fetch+render sequence mirrors list.Run itself.
    Drops the types import each action command was carrying only for
    the dup'd helper. Net −22 lines.
